# Binary: never diff, never convert. Keeps the four PNG figures byte-exact.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary

# Line endings. This repository is stored with CRLF (authored on Windows, text-mode
# writes; core.autocrlf=false here). There are deliberately NO text=auto / eol rules
# in this file yet: adding one would rewrite every tracked file on its next commit and
# turn every future diff into noise. If the repo is ever normalised to LF, do it as one
# dedicated commit ("chore: normalise line endings") with `* text=auto eol=lf` added
# here in the same commit, so nobody has to wonder which convention is canonical.
